# Styling

See `docs/design-system.md` for the full system.

- Define colors, fonts, radii and motion as tokens in `src/styles/globals.css`.
- Compose classes with `cn()` from `src/lib/cn`.
- Use semantic color utilities (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`), never palette steps or hex values.
- Use type roles for text (`type-display`, `type-heading`, `type-title`, `type-body`, `type-meta`, `type-eyebrow`) plus a color utility.
- Use `px-gutter` for the content inset inside the page grid.
- Reach for `Button`, `Badge`, `TextLink` and `List`/`ListItem` before writing ad-hoc classes.

```tsx
// BAD
<p className="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#a1a1aa]" />

// GOOD
<p className={cn("type-meta text-muted-foreground", className)} />
```
